eIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cost","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows15MinimumCostFlowV","text":"MinimumCostFlow","identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/MinimumCostFlow","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SZ","text":"SignedInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sz","text":"BinaryInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SZ","text":"SignedInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A positive supply is how much more the vertex sends than it receives; a negative one is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"demand. There is no flow when the supplies do not sum to zero or some set of vertices","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"supplies more than its out-edges carry. Costs may be negative, and negative cycles are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"saturated. A self-loop carries its capacity when its cost is negative and nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"otherwise. Capacities may be of an unsigned type, up to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int.max"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Computed by the network simplex with block-search pivots and strongly feasible trees."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Which optimum is returned when several exist is unspecified, but the same input always"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gives the same result. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"supply"},{"type":"text","text":" is called once per vertex in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, then, for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each edge in position order, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"type":"text","text":" and then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cost"},{"type":"text","text":", before any work."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every capacity is at least zero; capacities, supplies and costs fit in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"text":"; Σ capacity × |cost| fits in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Cost"},{"text":" (checked before solving, since it bounds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"total cost); 4(n + 1)(the greatest |cost| of a non-loop edge + 1) fits in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"text":" (the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"solver’s artificial cost, with room for its potentials and reduced costs); the positive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"supplies sum within ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Capacity"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/flows\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/minimumcostflow(supply:capacity:cost:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Flows/documentation/Flows/GraphProtocols":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/flows\/graphprotocols","title":"GraphProtocols","identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols","type":"topic","abstract":[]},"doc://Flows/documentation/Flows":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/flows","title":"Flows","identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows","type":"topic"},"doc://Flows/documentation/Flows/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/minimumCostFlow(supply:capacity:cost:)":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/flows\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/minimumcostflow(supply:capacity:cost:)","title":"minimumCostFlow(supply:capacity:cost:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"minimumCostFlow"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"supply"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14G